DESCRIPTION:You can self-host multiple side projects using nothing but an o
 ld Raspberry Pi\, your home wifi\, Django\, and actual duct tape. I’ll s
 how how to get around dynamic IP performance bottlenecks and achieve over 
 three nines of uptime while handling thousands of daily requests on a budg
 et of 0€ per month.
